<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DANISH CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DANISH CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Danish Cup</p>
<p>semifinal replay on Thursday:</p>
<p>Silkeborg    1     FC Copenhagen    2</p>
<p>Played Wednesday:</p>
<p>Brondby	0     Ikast		1</p>
<p>Final to be played in Copenhagen on May 8.</p>
</text>
